    {
      "id": "04-carbs",
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "carbs",
      "text": "11.4 grams of carbs. Glycemic index is low at 39, meaning carbs release slower and steadier, this helps avoid sharp blood sugar spikes. Fibre is 1.4 grams, which provides only a modest fullness and digestion support, this matters as fiber is an important factor for fruits. Sugar control and fibre are the most important bits of the carbohydrate profile of fruits.",
